    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "EFFECTIVE\nJANUARY 1,1962\nCOMPLETE SYSTEM TIMETABLE\nEASTERN\nAir Lines\nNEW\nQUICK REFERENCE\nTIMETABLE\nFIND YOUR FLIGHT FASTER\nSee page 2 for directions",
      "FLY EASTERN AIR LINES\nJANUARY-1962\nFEBRUARY—1962\nSun\nMon Tue Wed Thu Fri\nSat\nSun Mon Tue Wed Thu Fri\nSat\n2 3\n4 5\n6\n2\n3\n7\n8\n9 10 |1 12\n13\n4\n5\n6\n7\n8\n9\n10\n14\n15\n16 17 18 19\n20\n12\n13\n14\n15\n16\n17\n21\n22\n23 24 25 26 27\n18\n19\n20 21\n22\n23\n24\n28\n29\n30 3|\n25\n26 27 28\nEastern's money-saving Family Plan is in effect for Continental U.S.A.\nand Canada on the days indicated in the shaded areas above.\nNew Service on Eastern's\n\"AIRABUS\"\nBOSTON-TAMPA/ST. PETERSBURG-MIAMI\nYour ticket is your reservation! No need to reconfirm\nprior to boarding your flight!\nSee page 2 for complete \"Air-Bus\" information.\nA New Concept in Commuter Air Travel\n\"AIRESHUTTLE\"\nNEW YORK-BOSTON NEW YORK-WASHINGTON\nNo reservations made or needed! Just come out to the airport and\nboard! Weekday flights every hour on the hour 7 AM-10 PM.\nWeekend service nearly as frequent.\nSee page 2 for complete \"Air-Shuttle\" information."
    ],
